      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two patients with rare isolated posterior antral compartments are presented. In both cases, the radiologist directed the surgeon to these clinically hidden recesses. The radiographic appearance included a walled-off compartment filled with material of soft-tissue density; clinical importance is discussed."},
